<TEXT>
<HTML>
<HEAD>
  <TITLE></TITLE>
</HEAD>
<BODY STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif">

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: right; margin: 0"><B>Exhibit 99.1</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: center; margin: 0"><B>MICROCLOUD HOLOGRAM INC.</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: center; margin: 0"><B>NOTICE OF ANNUAL GENERAL MEETING OF MEMBERS</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: center; margin: 0"><B>To Be Held on September&nbsp;27, 2024</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify; margin: 0">To the Shareholders of MicroCloud Hologram Inc:</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify; margin: 0"><B>NOTICE IS HEREBY GIVEN</B>, that you are cordially invited to attend an annual general meeting (the &ldquo;<B>Annual Meeting</B>&rdquo;) of shareholders of MicroCloud Hologram Inc, a Cayman Islands exempted company with limited liability (the &ldquo;<B>Company</B>,&rdquo; &ldquo;<B>we</B>,&rdquo; &ldquo;<B>us</B>&rdquo; or &ldquo;<B>our</B>&rdquo;). The Annual Meeting is to be held at Company headquarters located at Room 302, Building A, Zhong Ke Na Neng Building, Yue Xing Sixth Road, Nanshan District, Shenzhen, People&rsquo;s Republic of China at 9:00 a.m., Beijing time, on Friday, September&nbsp;27, 2024, and at any adjournment or adjournments thereof, for the following purposes:</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE BORDER="0" CELLSPACING="0" CELLPADDING="0" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse">
  <TR>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify; vertical-align: top; width: 1in">Proposal 1 </TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify; vertical-align: top">
        <P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify">To consider and vote upon an ordinary resolution to effect a 1-for-20 share consolidation:</P>
        <P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>
        <P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify"><B>THAT </B>every 20 issued and unissued
ordinary shares of a nominal or par value of US$0.001 each in the capital of the Company (the &ldquo;<B>Ordinary Shares</B>&rdquo;) be
consolidated into one (1) share of a nominal or par value of US$0.02 each, and such Consolidated Shares shall rank pari passu in all
respects with each other in accordance with the Company&rsquo;s currently effective memorandum and articles of association (the &ldquo;<B>Share
Consolidation</B>&rdquo;) such that following the Share Consolidation the authorized share capital of the Company will be changed</P>
        <P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>
        <P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify"><B>FROM </B>US$500,000 divided into 500,000,000 shares of a nominal or par value of US$0.001 each</P>
        <P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>
        <P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify"><B>TO </B>US$500,000 divided into 25,000,000
        shares of a nominal or par value of US$0.02 each (the &ldquo;<B>Consolidated Ordinary Shares</B>&rdquo;)</P>
        <P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>
        <P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify">(the &ldquo;<B>Share Consolidation Proposal</B>&rdquo;);</P> </TD> </TR>
  </TABLE>

<P STYLE="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE BORDER="0" CELLSPACING="0" CELLPADDING="0" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse">
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="width: 1in; font-size: 10pt; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">Proposal 2</FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">
    <P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">To consider and vote upon an ordinary resolution
    to increase the Company&rsquo;s share capital after the Share Consolidation:</P>
    <P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>
    <P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><B>THAT </B>conditional upon and effective immediately
    following the Share Consolidation, increase the authorized share capital of the Company</P>
    <P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>
    <P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><B>FROM </B>US$500,000 divided into 25,000,000
    Consolidated Ordinary Shares,</P>
    <P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>
    <P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><B>TO</B> US$10,000,000 divided into 500,000,000
Consolidated Ordinary Shares (&ldquo;<B>Share Capital Increase</B>&rdquo;), by the creation of an additional 475,000,000 Consolidated
Ordinary Shares</P>
    <P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>
    <P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">(the &ldquo;<B>Share Capital Increase Proposal</B>&rdquo;);</P></TD></TR>
  </TABLE>


<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE BORDER="0" CELLSPACING="0" CELLPADDING="0" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse">
<TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="font-size: 10pt; text-align: justify; width: 1in"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">Proposal 3</FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">
    <P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">To consider
    and vote upon a special resolutio</FONT>n to delete the existing Article 15.6 of the Company&rsquo;s currently effective Amended
    and Restated Memorandum and Articles of Association (the &ldquo;<B>Current M&amp;A</B>&rdquo;) in its entirety and the <FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">substitution
    therefor the following:</FONT></P>
    <P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>
    <P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&ldquo;An appointment of a director may be
on terms that the director shall automatically retire from office (unless he has sooner vacated office) at the next or a subsequent annual
general meeting or upon any specified event or after any specified period in a written agreement between the Company and the director,
if any; but no such term shall be implied in the absence of express provision. Each director whose term of office expires shall be eligible
for re-election at a meeting of the Members or re-appointment by the board of directors.&rdquo;</P>
    <P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>
    <P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">(the &ldquo;<B>Articles Amendment Proposal</B>&rdquo;);</P></TD></TR>
</TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0">&nbsp;</P>



<!-- Field: Page; Sequence: 1 -->
    <DIV STYLE="margin-top: 6pt; margin-bottom: 6pt; border-bottom: Black 2pt solid"><P STYLE="font: normal 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: center; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt">&nbsp;</P></DIV>
    <DIV STYLE="break-before: page; margin-top: 6pt; margin-bottom: 6pt"><P STYLE="margin: 0pt">&#160;</P></DIV>
    <!-- Field: /Page -->

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0">&nbsp;</P>



<TABLE BORDER="0" CELLSPACING="0" CELLPADDING="0" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse">
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="width: 1in; font-size: 10pt; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">Proposal 4</FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">
    <P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">To consider and vote upon a special
    resolution to create a Dual-Class Structure (defined below) and adopt a second amended and restated memorandum and
    articles of association:</P>
    <P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>
    <P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">conditional upon and effective immediately following
    the Share Consolidation and the Share Capital Increase, vary the authorized share capital of the Company to create and adopt a dual-class
    share structure (the &ldquo;<B>Dual-Class Structure</B>&rdquo;) by</P>
    <P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>
    <P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">a) re-designating all the issued and outstanding
    Consolidated Ordinary Shares into class A ordinary shares of a nominal or par value of US$0.02 par value each (the &ldquo;<B>Class
    A Ordinary Shares</B>&rdquo;), and each Class A Ordinary Share shall be entitled to one (1) vote per Class A Ordinary Share;</P>
    <P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>
    <P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">b) re-designated
    379,455,801 authorized but unissued Consolidated Ordinary Shares into Class A Ordinary Shares;</P>
    <P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>
    <P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">c) re-designating 100,000,000 authorized
    but unissued Consolidated Ordinary Shares into class B ordinary shares of a nominal or par value of US$0.02 each (the &ldquo;<B>Class
    B Ordinary Shares</B>&rdquo;), and each Class B Ordinary Share shall be entitled to 20 votes per Class B Ordinary Share</P>
    <P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>
    <P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">(the &ldquo;<B>Variation of Share Capital</B>&rdquo;),</P>
    <P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>
    <P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">such that immediately following the Variation
    of Share Capital, the authorized share capital of the Company shall be changed</P>
    <P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>
    <P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">FROM US$10,000,000 divided into 500,000,000 Consolidated
    Ordinary Shares</P>
    <P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>
    <P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">TO US$10,000,000 divided into 400,000,000 Class
    A Ordinary Shares, and 100,000,000 Class B Ordinary Shares; and</P>
    <P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>
    <P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">adopt a second amended and restated memorandum and articles of association of the Company to, among other amendments, reflect the adoption
of the Dual-Class Structure and the Variation of Share Capital.</P>
    <P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>
    <P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">(the &ldquo;<B>Dual-Class Structure Proposal</B>&rdquo;);
    and</P>

</TD></TR>
  </TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE BORDER="0" CELLSPACING="0" CELLPADDING="0" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse">
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="width: 1in; font-size: 10pt; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">Proposal 5</FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="font-size: 10pt; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">To adjourn the Meeting to a later date or dates, if necessary, to permit further solicitation and vote of proxies in the event that there are insufficient votes for, or otherwise in connection with, the approval of Proposals 1 &ndash; 4. </FONT></TD></TR>
  </TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in; margin: 0">The foregoing items of
business are more fully described in the proxy statement accompanying this Notice. We are not aware of any other business to come
before the Annual Meeting.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in; margin: 0">Only shareholders of record at the close of business on August&nbsp;21, 2024 are entitled to notice and to vote at the Annual Meeting and any adjournment or postponement thereof.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in; margin: 0"><B>It is important that your shares are represented at the Annual Meeting. We urge you to review the attached Proxy Statement and, whether or not you plan to attend the Annual Meeting in person, please vote your shares promptly by casting your vote via the Internet, or, if you prefer to mail your proxy or voter instructions, please complete, sign, date, and return your proxy or vote instruction form in the pre-addressed envelope provided, which requires no additional postage if mailed in the United States. You may revoke your vote by submitting a subsequent vote over the Internet or by mail before the Annual Meeting, or by voting in person at the Annual Meeting.</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0">&nbsp;</P>



<!-- Field: Page; Sequence: 2 -->
    <DIV STYLE="margin-top: 6pt; margin-bottom: 6pt; border-bottom: Black 2pt solid"><P STYLE="font: normal 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: center; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt">&nbsp;</P></DIV>
    <DIV STYLE="break-before: page; margin-top: 6pt; margin-bottom: 6pt"><P STYLE="margin: 0pt">&#160;</P></DIV>
    <!-- Field: /Page -->

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in; margin: 0">If you plan to attend the Annual Meeting, please notify us of your intentions. This will assist us with meeting preparations. If your shares are not registered in your own name and you would like to attend the Annual Meeting, please follow the instructions contained in the proxy materials that are being mailed to you and any other information forwarded to you by your broker, trust, bank, or other holder of record to obtain a valid proxy from it. This will enable you to gain admission to the Annual Meeting and vote in person.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE BORDER="0" CELLSPACING="0" CELLPADDING="0" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse">
  <TR>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: left; vertical-align: top; width: 50%">August&nbsp;30, 2024</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: left; vertical-align: top; width: 50%">By Order of the Board of Directors,</TD> </TR>
  <TR>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: left; vertical-align: top">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: left; vertical-align: top">&nbsp;</TD> </TR>
  <TR>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: left; vertical-align: top">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="border-bottom: Black 1pt solid; text-align: left; vertical-align: top"><B>/s/ Wei Peng</B></TD> </TR>
  <TR>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: left; vertical-align: top">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: left; vertical-align: top">Wei Peng</TD> </TR>
  <TR>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: left; vertical-align: top">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: left; vertical-align: top">Chairman</TD> </TR>
  </TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in; margin: 0"><B>IMPORTANT NOTICE REGARDING THE AVAILABILITY OF PROXY MATERIALS FOR THE <FONT STYLE="text-transform: uppercase">ANNUAL MEETING</FONT><FONT STYLE="text-transform: uppercase"> OF MEMBERS TO BE</FONT> HELD ON SEPTEMBER 27, 2024</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in; margin: 0">This Notice and Proxy Statement are available online at http://ir.mcholo.com/index.php/index/index.html#.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0">&nbsp;</P>



<!-- Field: Page; Sequence: 3 -->
    <DIV STYLE="margin-top: 6pt; margin-bottom: 6pt; border-bottom: Black 2pt solid"><P STYLE="font: normal 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: center; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt">&nbsp;</P></DIV>
    <DIV STYLE="break-before: page; margin-top: 6pt; margin-bottom: 6pt"><P STYLE="margin: 0pt">&#160;</P></DIV>
    <!-- Field: /Page -->

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: center; margin: 0"><B>TABLE OF CONTENTS</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0">&nbsp;</P>



<TABLE CELLSPACING="0" CELLPADDING="0" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse">
  <TR>
    <TD STYLE="text-indent: -0.125in; padding-left: 0.125in; text-align: left; vertical-align: top">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="vertical-align: bottom; border-bottom: black 1pt solid; text-align: center"><B>Page</B></TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="background-color: rgb(204,238,255)">
    <TD STYLE="text-indent: -0.125in; padding-left: 0.125in; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; width: 90%"><B><A HREF="#a_001">GENERAL
    INFORMATION</A></B></TD>
    <TD STYLE="width: 1%"><B>&nbsp;</B></TD>
    <TD STYLE="vertical-align: bottom; width: 9%; text-align: center"><B>1</B></TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="background-color: White">
    <TD STYLE="text-indent: -0.125in; padding-left: 0.125in; text-align: left; vertical-align: top"><A HREF="#a_002">Purpose of Annual Meeting</A></TD>
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="vertical-align: bottom; text-align: center">1</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="background-color: rgb(204,238,255)">
    <TD STYLE="text-indent: -0.125in; padding-left: 0.125in; text-align: left; vertical-align: top"><A HREF="#a_003">Will there be any other items of business on the agenda?</A></TD>
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="vertical-align: bottom; text-align: center">3</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="background-color: White">
    <TD STYLE="text-indent: -0.125in; padding-left: 0.125in; text-align: left; vertical-align: top"><A HREF="#a_004">Who is entitled to vote at the Annual Meeting?</A></TD>
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="vertical-align: bottom; text-align: center">3</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="background-color: rgb(204,238,255)">
    <TD STYLE="text-indent: -0.125in; padding-left: 0.125in; text-align: left; vertical-align: top"><A HREF="#a_005">What constitutes a quorum and how will votes be counted?</A></TD>
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="vertical-align: bottom; text-align: center">3</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="background-color: White">
    <TD STYLE="text-indent: -0.125in; padding-left: 0.125in; text-align: left; vertical-align: top"><A HREF="#a_006">Votes Required</A></TD>
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="vertical-align: bottom; text-align: center">4</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="background-color: rgb(204,238,255)">
    <TD STYLE="text-indent: -0.125in; padding-left: 0.125in; text-align: left; vertical-align: top"><A HREF="#a_007">How do I vote?</A></TD>
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="vertical-align: bottom; text-align: center">4</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="background-color: White">
    <TD STYLE="text-indent: -0.125in; padding-left: 0.125in; text-align: left; vertical-align: top"><A HREF="#a_008">Revoking Your Proxy</A></TD>
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="vertical-align: bottom; text-align: center">5</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="background-color: rgb(204,238,255)">
    <TD STYLE="text-indent: -0.125in; padding-left: 0.125in; text-align: left; vertical-align: top"><A HREF="#a_009">Proxy Solicitation Costs</A></TD>
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="vertical-align: bottom; text-align: center">5</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="background-color: White">
    <TD STYLE="text-indent: -0.125in; padding-left: 0.125in; text-align: left; vertical-align: top"><B><A HREF="#a_010">PROPOSAL NO.
    1 SHARE CONSOLIDATION</A></B></TD>
    <TD><B>&nbsp;</B></TD>
    <TD STYLE="vertical-align: bottom; text-align: center"><B>6</B></TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="background-color: rgb(204,238,255)">
    <TD STYLE="text-indent: -0.125in; padding-left: 0.125in; text-align: left; vertical-align: top"><A HREF="#a_011">Purpose of Share Consolidation</A></TD>
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="vertical-align: bottom; text-align: center">6</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="background-color: White">
    <TD STYLE="text-indent: -0.125in; padding-left: 0.125in; text-align: left; vertical-align: top"><A HREF="#a_012">Effects of the Share Consolidation</A></TD>
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="vertical-align: bottom; text-align: center">7</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="background-color: rgb(204,238,255)">
    <TD STYLE="text-indent: -0.125in; padding-left: 0.125in; text-align: left; vertical-align: top"><A HREF="#a_013">Procedure for Implementing the Share Consolidation</A></TD>
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="vertical-align: bottom; text-align: center">8</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="background-color: White">
    <TD STYLE="text-indent: -0.125in; padding-left: 0.125in; text-align: left; vertical-align: top"><A HREF="#a_014">Federal Income Tax Consequences of the Share Consolidation</A></TD>
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="vertical-align: bottom; text-align: center">9</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="background-color: rgb(204,238,255)">
    <TD STYLE="text-indent: -0.125in; padding-left: 0.125in; text-align: left; vertical-align: top"><A HREF="#a_015">Vote Required</A></TD>
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="vertical-align: bottom; text-align: center">9</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="background-color: White">
    <TD STYLE="text-indent: -0.125in; padding-left: 0.125in; text-align: left; vertical-align: top"><A HREF="#a_016">Recommendation of the Board</A></TD>
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="vertical-align: bottom; text-align: center">9</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="background-color: rgb(204,238,255)">
    <TD STYLE="text-indent: -0.125in; padding-left: 0.125in; text-align: left; vertical-align: top"><B><A HREF="#a_017">PROPOSAL NO.
    2 SHARE CAPITAL INCREASE</A></B></TD>
    <TD><B>&nbsp;</B></TD>
    <TD STYLE="vertical-align: bottom; text-align: center"><B>10</B></TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="background-color: White">
    <TD STYLE="text-indent: -0.125in; padding-left: 0.125in; text-align: left; vertical-align: top"><A HREF="#a_018">Vote Required</A></TD>
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="vertical-align: bottom; text-align: center">10</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="background-color: rgb(204,238,255)">
    <TD STYLE="text-indent: -0.125in; padding-left: 0.125in; text-align: left; vertical-align: top"><A HREF="#a_019">Recommendation of the Board</A></TD>
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="vertical-align: bottom; text-align: center">10</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="background-color: White">
    <TD STYLE="text-indent: -0.125in; padding-left: 0.125in; text-align: left; vertical-align: top"><B><A HREF="#a_020">OTHER MATTERS</A></B></TD>
    <TD><B>&nbsp;</B></TD>
    <TD STYLE="vertical-align: bottom; text-align: center"><B>16</B></TD></TR>
  </TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0">&nbsp;</P>



